  "description": "The organized effort by LGBTQ+ individuals and allies to secure equal rights, including legal recognition of same-sex relationships, protection from discrimination, and social acceptance. The meme is a form of visual activism, using imagery and text to promote the message of LGBTQ+ rights and challenge societal stigma. The phrase 'love is love' is a common rallying cry in this movement.",
